{"seq":1,"slug":"tenant-lifecycle-management","title":"租户生命周期管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/platform-engineering/tenant-lifecycle-management","wordCount":1265,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"租户生命周期管理\">租户生命周期管理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>租户生命周期</strong>：租户从 Provisioning 到 Deletion 的完整状态流转过程</li>\n<li><strong>Provisioning（供应）</strong>：为新租户分配并初始化所有必要资源的自动化流程</li>\n<li><strong>补偿事务（Saga）</strong>：分布式 Provisioning 中，任一步失败时回滚已完成步骤的机制</li>\n<li><strong>软暂停 / 硬暂停</strong>：对欠费或违规租户的分级限制策略</li>\n<li><strong>保留期（Retention Period）</strong>：删除前保留数据的法定或合同约定期限</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"生命周期的全貌\">生命周期的全貌</h2><p>租户生命周期涵盖一个客户组织从首次接触平台到最终离场的完整历程。成熟的多租户平台需要将每个阶段自动化——人工介入越少，onboarding 越快、offboarding 越干净、运维风险越低。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; Provisioning: 注册/签约&#10;    Provisioning --&gt; Active: 初始化完成&#10;    Active --&gt; Suspended: 欠费/违规&#10;    Suspended --&gt; Active: 恢复付费/解除&#10;    Suspended --&gt; PendingDeletion: 超期未恢复&#10;    Active --&gt; PendingDeletion: 主动注销&#10;    PendingDeletion --&gt; Deleted: 保留期结束&#10;    Deleted --&gt; [*]&#10;&#10;    Active --&gt; Migrating: 升级/降级隔离层&#10;    Migrating --&gt; Active: 迁移完成\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Provisioning: 注册/签约\n    Provisioning --&gt; Active: 初始化完成\n    Active --&gt; Suspended: 欠费/违规\n    Suspended --&gt; Active: 恢复付费/解除\n    Suspended --&gt; PendingDeletion: 超期未恢复\n    Active --&gt; PendingDeletion: 主动注销\n    PendingDeletion --&gt; Deleted: 保留期结束\n    Deleted --&gt; [*]\n\n    Active --&gt; Migrating: 升级/降级隔离层\n    Migrating --&gt; Active: 迁移完成</pre><p>每个状态转换都必须是原子的、可审计的、可回滚的。一个租户不应该处于「半初始化」或「半删除」的不一致状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"provisioning-秒级-onboarding\">Provisioning：秒级 Onboarding</h2><p>Provisioning 是租户的第一印象——PLG（Product-Led Growth）产品要求从注册到可用在 30 秒内完成。不同隔离模型的 Provisioning 成本差异巨大：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>隔离模型</th>\n<th>Provisioning 步骤</th>\n<th>耗时</th>\n<th>可优化到</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Pool</td>\n<td>INSERT tenant 记录 + 分配配额</td>\n<td>&lt; 100ms</td>\n<td>无需优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bridge</td>\n<td>创建 Schema + 执行迁移 + 授权</td>\n<td>2-10s</td>\n<td>预建 Schema 池</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Silo</td>\n<td>创建 DB 实例 + 网络配置 + 迁移</td>\n<td>3-10min</td>\n<td>预热池 + 异步切换</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"编排引擎设计\">编排引擎设计</h3><p>Provisioning 涉及多个子系统的协调操作，需要事务性编排：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    START[CreateTenant API] --&gt; VAL[参数验证&lt;br/&gt;唯一性检查]&#10;    VAL --&gt; META[写入租户元数据&lt;br/&gt;status = provisioning]&#10;    META --&gt; PAR{并行执行}&#10;&#10;    PAR --&gt; DB_INIT[数据存储初始化]&#10;    PAR --&gt; CACHE_INIT[缓存空间分配]&#10;    PAR --&gt; QUEUE_INIT[消息队列创建]&#10;    PAR --&gt; STORAGE_INIT[对象存储 Bucket]&#10;&#10;    DB_INIT --&gt; JOIN[等待全部完成]&#10;    CACHE_INIT --&gt; JOIN&#10;    QUEUE_INIT --&gt; JOIN&#10;    STORAGE_INIT --&gt; JOIN&#10;&#10;    JOIN --&gt; CONFIG[写入路由配置]&#10;    CONFIG --&gt; ACTIVATE[status = active]&#10;    ACTIVATE --&gt; NOTIFY[发送欢迎通知]&#10;&#10;    PAR -.-&gt;|任一失败| COMPENSATE[补偿回滚&lt;br/&gt;清理已创建资源]&#10;    COMPENSATE --&gt; FAILED[status = failed]\">graph TD\n    START[CreateTenant API] --&gt; VAL[参数验证&lt;br/&gt;唯一性检查]\n    VAL --&gt; META[写入租户元数据&lt;br/&gt;status = provisioning]\n    META --&gt; PAR{并行执行}\n\n    PAR --&gt; DB_INIT[数据存储初始化]\n    PAR --&gt; CACHE_INIT[缓存空间分配]\n    PAR --&gt; QUEUE_INIT[消息队列创建]\n    PAR --&gt; STORAGE_INIT[对象存储 Bucket]\n\n    DB_INIT --&gt; JOIN[等待全部完成]\n    CACHE_INIT --&gt; JOIN\n    QUEUE_INIT --&gt; JOIN\n    STORAGE_INIT --&gt; JOIN\n\n    JOIN --&gt; CONFIG[写入路由配置]\n    CONFIG --&gt; ACTIVATE[status = active]\n    ACTIVATE --&gt; NOTIFY[发送欢迎通知]\n\n    PAR -.-&gt;|任一失败| COMPENSATE[补偿回滚&lt;br/&gt;清理已创建资源]\n    COMPENSATE --&gt; FAILED[status = failed]</pre><p><strong>补偿事务（Saga 模式）</strong> 是关键：Provisioning 的每一步都必须有对应的补偿操作。当第 4 步失败时，前 3 步已创建的资源必须被清理，否则产生孤儿资源。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ProvisioningStep {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  execute(context: TenantContext): Promise&lt;StepResult&gt;;&#10;  compensate(context: TenantContext): Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const provisioningSteps: ProvisioningStep[] = [&#10;  {&#10;    name: &#39;create_schema&#39;,&#10;    execute: async (ctx) =&gt; createTenantSchema(ctx.tenantId),&#10;    compensate: async (ctx) =&gt; dropSchema(ctx.tenantId),&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    name: &#39;create_cache_namespace&#39;,&#10;    execute: async (ctx) =&gt; createCacheNamespace(ctx.tenantId),&#10;    compensate: async (ctx) =&gt; deleteCacheNamespace(ctx.tenantId),&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    name: &#39;create_storage_bucket&#39;,&#10;    execute: async (ctx) =&gt; createBucket(ctx.tenantId),&#10;    compensate: async (ctx) =&gt; deleteBucket(ctx.tenantId),&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProvisioningStep</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TenantContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">StepResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  compensate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TenantContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> provisioningSteps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProvisioningStep</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'create_schema'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createTenantSchema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx.tenantId),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    compensate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dropSchema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx.tenantId),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'create_cache_namespace'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createCacheNamespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx.tenantId),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    compensate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> deleteCacheNamespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx.tenantId),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'create_storage_bucket'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createBucket</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx.tenantId),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    compensate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> deleteBucket</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx.tenantId),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"租户暂停与恢复\">租户暂停与恢复</h2><p>暂停（Suspend）是介于活跃和删除之间的中间状态，用于处理欠费、违规或客户主动请求暂停的场景。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>暂停级别</th>\n<th>限制</th>\n<th>数据保留</th>\n<th>典型触发</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>软暂停（Grace Period）</td>\n<td>写入禁止、读取允许</td>\n<td>完全保留</td>\n<td>欠费 7 天内</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬暂停（Full Suspend）</td>\n<td>所有 API 返回 403</td>\n<td>完全保留</td>\n<td>欠费 30 天/违规</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冻结（Frozen）</td>\n<td>API 不可达、后台任务停止</td>\n<td>保留但不可访问</td>\n<td>法务要求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>暂停的实现要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在 API 网关层拦截（而非应用层），减少被暂停租户对系统资源的消耗</li>\n<li>暂停状态缓存到 CDN/边缘节点，确保低延迟判定</li>\n<li>恢复操作必须是幂等的——多次调用结果一致</li>\n<li>暂停期间不停止计量（用于计算欠费金额）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"offboarding-数据删除与合规\">Offboarding：数据删除与合规</h2><p>租户删除是最敏感的生命周期操作，必须同时满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>完整性</strong>：不留下任何孤儿数据</li>\n<li><strong>可追溯</strong>：审计日志记录删除过程</li>\n<li><strong>保留期</strong>：法规可能要求数据保留一定时间后才能物理删除</li>\n<li><strong>不可逆确认</strong>：防止误操作</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Admin as 租户管理员&#10;    participant API as 管理 API&#10;    participant Orch as 删除编排器&#10;    participant DB as 数据层&#10;    participant Stor as 对象存储&#10;    participant Audit as 审计日志&#10;&#10;    Admin-&gt;&gt;API: 发起注销请求&#10;    API-&gt;&gt;API: 二次确认(短信/邮件验证码)&#10;    API-&gt;&gt;Orch: 启动删除流程&#10;    Orch-&gt;&gt;DB: status = pending_deletion&#10;    Orch-&gt;&gt;Audit: 记录删除发起&#10;&#10;    Note over Orch: 等待保留期(30天)&#10;&#10;    Orch-&gt;&gt;DB: 导出数据归档(合规留档)&#10;    Orch-&gt;&gt;DB: 物理删除租户数据&#10;    Orch-&gt;&gt;Stor: 清理对象存储&#10;    Orch-&gt;&gt;DB: 清理元数据&#10;    Orch-&gt;&gt;Audit: 记录删除完成&#10;    Orch-&gt;&gt;API: 删除完成通知\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Admin as 租户管理员\n    participant API as 管理 API\n    participant Orch as 删除编排器\n    participant DB as 数据层\n    participant Stor as 对象存储\n    participant Audit as 审计日志\n\n    Admin-&gt;&gt;API: 发起注销请求\n    API-&gt;&gt;API: 二次确认(短信/邮件验证码)\n    API-&gt;&gt;Orch: 启动删除流程\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;DB: status = pending_deletion\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;Audit: 记录删除发起\n\n    Note over Orch: 等待保留期(30天)\n\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;DB: 导出数据归档(合规留档)\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;DB: 物理删除租户数据\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;Stor: 清理对象存储\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;DB: 清理元数据\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;Audit: 记录删除完成\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;API: 删除完成通知</pre><p>各隔离模型的删除复杂度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>Silo</th>\n<th>Bridge</th>\n<th>Pool</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据删除</td>\n<td>DROP DATABASE</td>\n<td>DROP SCHEMA CASCADE</td>\n<td>DELETE WHERE tenant_id = X</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否影响其他租户</td>\n<td>完全不影响</td>\n<td>不影响</td>\n<td>大量 DELETE 可能导致锁争用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储回收</td>\n<td>即时（实例释放）</td>\n<td>需 VACUUM</td>\n<td>需 VACUUM FULL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>验证完整性</td>\n<td>实例不存在即完成</td>\n<td>Schema 不存在即完成</td>\n<td>需扫描确认无残留</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可逆性</td>\n<td>从快照恢复</td>\n<td>从 pg_dump 恢复</td>\n<td>困难（需逻辑备份）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"租户元数据模型\">租户元数据模型</h2><p>所有生命周期操作的基础是一个健壮的租户注册表：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface TenantRecord {&#10;  // 身份&#10;  tenantId: string; // UUID, immutable&#10;  slug: string; // URL-friendly identifier&#10;  displayName: string;&#10;&#10;  // 状态&#10;  status: &#39;provisioning&#39; | &#39;active&#39; | &#39;suspended&#39; | &#39;pending_deletion&#39; | &#39;deleted&#39;;&#10;  statusReason?: string; // 暂停/删除原因&#10;  statusChangedAt: Date;&#10;&#10;  // 隔离配置&#10;  isolationTier: &#39;silo&#39; | &#39;bridge&#39; | &#39;pool&#39;;&#10;  dbEndpoint?: string; // Silo: 专属实例地址&#10;  schemaName?: string; // Bridge: Schema 名称&#10;  poolClusterId?: string; // Pool: 所属集群&#10;&#10;  // 配额&#10;  quotaProfile: string; // 引用配额模板&#10;  storageQuotaBytes: number;&#10;  apiRateLimitPerMin: number;&#10;&#10;  // 审计&#10;  createdAt: Date;&#10;  createdBy: string;&#10;  lastActiveAt: Date;&#10;  deletionScheduledAt?: Date;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TenantRecord</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 身份</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  tenantId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// UUID, immutable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  slug</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// URL-friendly identifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  displayName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'provisioning'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'active'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'suspended'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pending_deletion'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'deleted'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  statusReason</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 暂停/删除原因</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  statusChangedAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 隔离配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  isolationTier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'silo'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'bridge'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pool'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  dbEndpoint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Silo: 专属实例地址</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  schemaName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Bridge: Schema 名称</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  poolClusterId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Pool: 所属集群</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 配额</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  quotaProfile</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 引用配额模板</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  storageQuotaBytes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  apiRateLimitPerMin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 审计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  createdAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  createdBy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  lastActiveAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  deletionScheduledAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"状态机实现与事件驱动\">状态机实现与事件驱动</h2><p>租户状态变更应通过事件驱动架构传播，确保所有子系统感知并响应：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件</th>\n<th>触发系统</th>\n<th>消费者</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>tenant.created</code></td>\n<td>Provisioning 引擎</td>\n<td>计费、通知、监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tenant.activated</code></td>\n<td>Provisioning 引擎</td>\n<td>网关路由更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tenant.suspended</code></td>\n<td>计费系统/Admin</td>\n<td>网关（拒绝请求）、后台任务调度器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tenant.resumed</code></td>\n<td>计费系统/Admin</td>\n<td>网关（恢复路由）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tenant.deletion_scheduled</code></td>\n<td>Admin API</td>\n<td>数据归档、通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tenant.deleted</code></td>\n<td>删除编排器</td>\n<td>资源回收、指标清理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tenant.tier_changed</code></td>\n<td>迁移引擎</td>\n<td>路由更新、配额调整</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>事件设计的关键原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>事件携带足够上下文（不只是 ID，包含状态变更前后的快照）</li>\n<li>消费者幂等处理（同一事件可能重复投递）</li>\n<li>事件持久化（用于审计和状态重建）</li>\n<li>最终一致性容忍窗口定义清晰（如路由更新允许 5 秒延迟）</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>租户生命周期管理是多租户平台的运营骨架。Provisioning 需要 Saga 模式保证原子性和可补偿性；暂停/恢复需要在网关层拦截并分级处理；Offboarding 必须满足完整性、可追溯和保留期要求。所有状态变更通过事件驱动传播，确保子系统解耦且最终一致。不同隔离模型的生命周期操作复杂度差异显著——Pool 的 Provisioning 最快（毫秒级）但删除最慢（大量 DELETE），Silo 相反。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"resource-quota-fairness\">资源配额与公平性</a> 详细说明了如何在租户活跃期间保障资源公平分配。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"租户生命周期管理","id":"租户生命周期管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"生命周期的全貌","id":"生命周期的全貌"},{"level":2,"text":"Provisioning：秒级 Onboarding","id":"provisioning-秒级-onboarding"},{"level":3,"text":"编排引擎设计","id":"编排引擎设计"},{"level":2,"text":"租户暂停与恢复","id":"租户暂停与恢复"},{"level":2,"text":"Offboarding：数据删除与合规","id":"offboarding-数据删除与合规"},{"level":2,"text":"租户元数据模型","id":"租户元数据模型"},{"level":2,"text":"状态机实现与事件驱动","id":"状态机实现与事件驱动"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"行级安全隔离（Row-Level Security）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/data-layer/row-level-security"},"next":{"title":"资源配额与公平性保障","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/platform-engineering/resource-quota-fairness"}}